<title>SPAIN: RALLYING-CATALUNYA RALLY STANDINGS AFTER SECOND DAY.</title>
<headline>RALLYING-CATALUNYA RALLY STANDINGS AFTER SECOND DAY.</headline>
<dateline>LLORET DE MAR, Spain 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading standings at</p>
<p>the end of the second day of the three-day 1,368-km event on</p>
<p>Tuesday:</p>
<p> 1. Piero Liatti (Italy) Subaru Impreza	 three hours eight</p>
<p>minutes 50 seconds</p>
<p> 2. Colin McRae (Braitain) Subaru Impreza     3 seconds behind</p>
<p> 3. Freddie Loix (Belgium) Toyota Celica GT4	32</p>
<p> 4. Bruno Thiry (Belgium) Ford Escort Cosworth    46</p>
<p> 5. Tommi Makinen (Finland) Mitsubishi Lancer   1:13</p>
<p> 6. Patrick Bernardini (France) Ford Escort     2:13</p>
<p> 7. Kenneth Eriksson (Sweden) Subaru Impreza    2:19</p>
<p> 8. Oriol Gomez (Spain) Renault Megane	    3:04</p>
<p> 9. Rui Madeira (Portugal) Toyota Celica GT4    3:40</p>
<p> 10 Andrea Medeghini (Italy) Subaru Impreza     4:34</p>
